 where local musicians and scholars host conversations connecting their pra
 ctice to works on view in the museum’s collection. This month’s Musica
 l Encounters program will feature a performance by percussionist\, compose
 r and band leader Mike Dillon based on the presentation of Peruvian Vicere
 gal paintings found in the second floor Arts of the Americas galleries. In
 cluded with museum admission\, which is free for Louisiana residents every
