DESCRIPTION:Virginia-Highland Church is proud to present an all new experi
 mental theatre performance devised by local artists titled F*CK THIS\, I
 ’M GOING TO CHURCH taking place at Virginia-Highland Church every weeken
 d of March. March 06 – March 28\, 2026 Fridays at 8:00pm Saturdays at 3:
 00pm and 7:00pm F*CK THIS\, I’M GOING TO CHURCH is an immersive\, experi
 mental theatre experience that reclaims the idea of church as loving commu
 nity\, rejecting religious dogma that preaches shame\, judgment\, oppressi
 on\, and abuse. In the midst of our tumultuous political climate and with 
 the rise of harmful Christian nationalism\, local Atlanta theatre artists 
 have come together to devise a performance that seeks to disman\nCategory:
  Theater\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/fck-this-im-goin
 g-to-church/2026-11-14/
LOCATION:Virginia-Highlands Church\, 743 Virginia Ave NE\, Atlanta
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/fck-this-im-going-to-church/2026-11-14/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
