  February 22nd\, April 12th\, October 25th\, and November 15th. This Music
  in the Garden is hosted in partnership with the Indian Arts Circle of New
  Orleans\, featuring musical and dance performances\; food from local vend
 ors including Inaayat\, Taj Mahal/Nirvana Indian Cuisine\, and others\; an
 d art making activities including Kolam and more. This program will take p
 lace in the sculpture’s garden Amphitheater. To arrive at the Amphitheat
 er\, enter the garden through the entrance on Enrique Alfé\nCategory: Per
 formances\nOriginal listing: https://noma.org/event/music-in-the-garden-no
 vember-15/
