DESCRIPTION:On Set ATL: Season 4 Premiere — Homegrown: The Southern Livi
 ng Room On Set ATL returns for its fourth season with *Homegrown: The Sout
 hern Living Room*\, an evening celebrating independent cinema\, Southern s
 torytelling\, and the creative voices shaping Atlanta’s film community. 
 Taking place Wednesday\, November 18\, 2026\, the season premiere will fea
 ture a curated lineup of independent films\, including a documentary scree
 ning from acclaimed actress\, director\, and filmmaker Jasmine Guy\, along
 side opportunities for audiences to connect with the artists and storytell
 ers behind the work. Rooted in the belief that some of our most meaningful
  stories are told in the living room\, *Homegrown* reimagines\nCategory: F
