 cs At The Movies series. This event is free and open to the public\; Ticke
 t reservation is required. SYNOPSIS: In the spring of 2019\, Academy Award
 -nominated filmmaker Scott Hamilton Kennedy began investigating a global m
 easles epidemic. He filmed with both top public health officials working t
