 e discussion “The Work We Live With: Women in Photography” include pho
 tographer\, curator\, and collector Tina Freeman\; photographer and filmma
 ker Sienna Pinderhughes\; and photographer and founder of Women Photograph
  Daniella Zalcman. The conversation will be moderated by Emilia Mickeviciu
